00:06:48.508 --> 00:06:49.675
SECOND STAGE IS OF OUR OFFICE'S

00:06:49.742 --> 00:06:52.078
INVOLVEMENT IS THAT STATE LAW

00:06:52.145 --> 00:06:53.279
