00:06:53.346 --> 00:06:55.448
ANALYZES OF ALL QUALIFIED,

00:06:55.515 --> 00:06:58.351
QUALIFIED, STATEWIDE BALLOT

00:06:58.417 --> 00:06:59.318
PROPOSITIONS FOR THE VOTER

00:06:59.385 --> 00:07:01.621
INFORMATION GUIDE. THIS ANALYSIS

00:07:01.687 --> 00:07:03.256
INCLUDES A DESCRIPTION OF THE

00:07:03.322 --> 00:07:04.490
