00:07:04.557 --> 00:07:06.292
EFFECTS ON THE STATE AND LOCAL

00:07:06.359 --> 00:07:07.860
GOVERNMENT. AND THAT'S WHAT I'LL

00:07:07.927 --> 00:07:08.995
BE TALKING ABOUT TODAY. MOVING

00:07:09.061 --> 00:07:11.998
TO PAGE TWO, I'M GOING TO

00:07:12.064 --> 00:07:13.699
PROVIDE SOME VERY BRIEF,

00:07:13.766 --> 00:07:17.136
BACKGROUND, WHICH IS THAT

00:07:17.203 --> 00:07:18.204
PUNISHMENT GENERALLY DEPENDS ON

00:07:18.271 --> 00:07:20.273
THE SERIOUSNESS OF THE CRIME AND

00:07:20.339 --> 00:07:21.374
THE PERSON'S CRIMINAL HISTORY.

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:23.176
SO PUNISHMENT FOR FELONIES CAN

00:07:23.242 --> 00:07:26.078
INCLUDE SENTENCE A SENTENCE TO

00:07:26.145 --> 00:07:28.614
COUNTY JAIL OR STATE PRISON,

00:07:28.681 --> 00:07:29.682
DEPENDING ON THE PERSON'S CRIME

00:07:29.749 --> 00:07:31.284
AND THEIR CRIMINAL HISTORY. IN

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:32.451
SOME CASES, PEOPLE CAN BE

00:07:32.518 --> 00:07:34.487
SUPERVISED IN THE COMMUNITY IN

00:07:34.554 --> 00:07:38.224
LIEU OF SERVING SOME OR ALL OF

00:07:38.291 --> 00:07:39.659
THEIR SENTENCE IN JAIL OR

00:07:39.725 --> 00:07:40.760
PRISON. THE LENGTH OF THE

00:07:40.827 --> 00:07:43.362
SENTENCE MOSTLY DEPENDS ON THE

00:07:43.429 --> 00:07:44.497
CRIME. SO, FOR EXAMPLE, A

00:07:44.564 --> 00:07:46.265
SENTENCE FOR MURDER COULD BE 15

00:07:46.332 --> 00:07:47.500
YEARS OR MORE IN STATE PRISON,

00:07:47.567 --> 00:07:49.402
WHEREAS A SENTENCE FOR SELLING

00:07:49.468 --> 00:07:51.270
DRUGS COULD BE UP TO FIVE YEARS

00:07:51.337 --> 00:07:52.538
IN JAIL OR PRISON, DEPENDING ON

00:07:52.605 --> 00:07:54.607
THE PERSON'S CRIMINAL HISTORY.

00:07:54.674 --> 00:07:55.575
SENTENCES, HOWEVER, CAN BE

00:07:55.641 --> 00:07:57.476
LENGTHENED BASED ON DETAILS OF

00:07:57.543 --> 00:08:01.581
THE CRIME. THIS IS CALLED AN

00:08:01.647 --> 00:08:04.050
ENHANCEMENT OFTENTIMES SO FOR

00:08:04.116 --> 00:08:06.953
EXAMPLE, SELLING CERTAIN DRUGS

00:08:07.019 --> 00:08:10.022
CAN IF THE PERSON SELLS A VERY

00:08:10.089 --> 00:08:11.157
LARGE QUANTITY OF DRUGS, CAN BE

00:08:11.224 --> 00:08:13.392
LENGTHENED. IN ADDITION TO THE

00:08:13.459 --> 00:08:16.362
BASE TERM FOR DRUG SALES, BASED

00:08:16.429 --> 00:08:18.231
ON THE AMOUNT OF DRUGS THAT THE

00:08:18.297 --> 00:08:19.165
PERSON SOLD, PEOPLE SENTENCED,

00:08:19.232 --> 00:08:22.401
OR PEOPLE CONVICTED OF

00:08:22.468 --> 00:08:23.569
MISDEMEANORS CAN BE SENTENCED TO

00:08:23.636 --> 00:08:24.503
COUNTY JAIL. COMMUNITY

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:26.372
SUPERVISION, AND OR A FINE, AND

00:08:26.439 --> 00:08:28.507
SENTENCES FOR A MISDEMEANOR CAN

00:08:28.574 --> 00:08:30.710
BE UP TO ONE YEAR IN JAIL. IN

00:08:30.776 --> 00:08:33.346
2014, PROPOSITION 47 REDUCED

00:08:33.412 --> 00:08:34.413
VARIOUS CRIMES FROM THEFT AND

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:36.816
DRUG CRIMES FROM FELONIES TO

00:08:36.883 --> 00:08:38.184
MISDEMEANORS. EXAMPLES INCLUDE

00:08:38.251 --> 00:08:40.820
SHOPLIFTING AND SIMPLE DRUG

00:08:40.887 --> 00:08:43.856
POSSESSION. MOVING ON TO PAGE

00:08:43.923 --> 00:08:45.024
THREE, I'M GOING TO PROVIDE A

00:08:45.091 --> 00:08:46.525
HIGH LEVEL OVERVIEW OF WHAT

00:08:46.592 --> 00:08:48.527
PROPOSITION 36 WOULD DO. IT

00:08:48.594 --> 00:08:49.795
WOULD MAKE VARIOUS CHANGES TO

00:08:49.862 --> 00:08:52.498
STATE LAW THAT GENERALLY FALL

00:08:52.565 --> 00:08:54.000
INTO KIND OF THREE COMPONENTS.

00:08:54.066 --> 00:08:55.101
SO THE FIRST COMPONENT IS THAT

00:08:55.167 --> 00:08:56.836
THE MEASURE WOULD INCREASE

00:08:56.903 --> 00:08:57.904
PUNISHMENT FOR SOME THEFT AND

00:08:57.970 --> 00:09:00.606
DRUG CRIMES, AND IT WOULD DO SO

00:09:00.673 --> 00:09:04.477
IN THREE GENERAL WAYS. THE FIRST

00:09:04.543 --> 00:09:05.611
WAY THAT IT WOULD INCREASE

00:09:05.678 --> 00:09:07.280
PUNISHMENT IS THAT IT WOULD

00:09:07.346 --> 00:09:08.281
CONVERT SOME MISDEMEANOR CRIMES

00:09:08.347 --> 00:09:10.416
INTO FELONIES. SO, FOR EXAMPLE,

00:09:10.483 --> 00:09:12.785
AS I MENTIONED, SHOPLIFTING IS

00:09:12.852 --> 00:09:13.819
GENERALLY A MISDEMEANOR UNDER

00:09:13.886 --> 00:09:17.189
CURRENT LAW. UNDER PROP 36, IF

00:09:17.256 --> 00:09:19.125
THE PERSON HAS TWO OR MORE PAST

00:09:19.191 --> 00:09:20.359
