00:09:23.296 --> 00:09:26.499
CHANGES THAT SHIFT SOME

00:09:26.565 --> 00:09:29.368
MISDEMEANORS TO FELONIES WOULD

00:09:29.435 --> 00:09:30.569
UNDO SOME OF THE PUNISHMENT

00:09:30.636 --> 00:09:31.437
REDUCTIONS THAT WERE IN

00:09:31.504 --> 00:09:34.206
PROPOSITION 47. THE SECOND WAY

00:09:34.273 --> 00:09:37.243
THAT PROP 36 WOULD INCREASE

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:38.377
PUNISHMENT IS THAT IT WOULD

00:09:38.444 --> 00:09:39.845
LENGTHEN SOME FELONY SENTENCES.

00:09:39.912 --> 00:09:42.815
SO, FOR EXAMPLE, PROPOSITION 36

00:09:42.882 --> 00:09:45.284
WOULD ALLOW FELONY SENTENCES FOR

